| Prints n! for n = 0 to 10, using a recursive subroutine.

        HIA.w   R2, 0           | R2 = n
LOOP:   HIA     R1, R2
        SBR     FACT            | R0 = R1!
        DRU
        NWL
        OPT.w   R2, 1
        VGL.w   R2, 11
        VSP     KL, LOOP
        STP

| FACT: R0 = R1!, preserves R1.
FACT:   VGL.w   R1, 1
        VSP     GR, RECURSE
        HIA.w   R0, 1
        KTG
RECURSE:
        BST     R1
        AFT.w   R1, 1
        SBR     FACT            | R0 = (n - 1)!
        HST     R1
        VER     R0, R1
        KTG

        EINDPR
